    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκλῐνής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lending to neither side,
				unswerving</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				109a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ δίκαιον</span>
				Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.144D.
			</span></i>; <i>impartial</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					904.9
				</span></i>
			 (V <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>); <i>regular</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκλινέων καλάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.11
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>), etc.: Math., <i>without inclination</i>, of a
			perpendicular, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				p.132F.
			</span></i>; <i>horizontal</i>, of a plane, <i><span class="en">
				Papp.
				1048.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Dioptr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>: <i><span class="en">
				Music.
			</span></i>, <i>fixed</i>, of notes in scale, <i><span class="en">
				Alyp.
				4
			</span></i>: Medic., <i>persistent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.20.24
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.669
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.54
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
